      "writtenOn": "2026-04-13T20:14:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hmm, ok, if the work is too small to get measurable results, that makes sense to run the same benchmark multiple times in each `Step`. Is there any reason that we need multiple textures though? Couldn\u0027t we just run the same pass on the same texture multiple times? Or are you concerned that we may de-duplicate work (do we?)?\n\nSorry for being picky, I think the perf tests are already a bit confusing to understand sometimes, so just want to make them as concise and simple as possible.",
      "parentUuid": "a7f0edd2_496bfe88",
      "revId": "3248b015948ef35a2111951e70c01925099099ae",
