      "writtenOn": "2026-04-15T17:15:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I have removed one pass in one iteration of `LoadStoreOpPerfTest` (3 passes down to 2) but still keep 2 passes. The reason I use multiple textures and multiple passes are that:\n- It reduces the risk of driver doing some optimizations that de-duplicate the identical render passes.\n- It prevents the driver from merging multiple render passes to one single render pass with the same load \u0026 store op.\n- It mimics multiple passes use cases in Skia where the resolve texture is used as resolve target in one pass then used as render attachment in another single-sampled render pass.\n\nI have also added the comments to the test.",
      "parentUuid": "eb630331_77ed0654",
      "revId": "3248b015948ef35a2111951e70c01925099099ae",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
